    <summary>Token-optimized CLI proxy for AI coding tools</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
tok0 is a high-performance CLI proxy that reduces LLM token consumption by
60-90% on typical development operations (git, cargo, npm, docker, kubectl,
and more).

Install hooks into your AI coding tool and tok0 automatically compresses
verbose command output before it reaches the model.

## Install

    choco install tok0

Then:

    tok0 init       # install hooks
    tok0 status     # verify
    tok0 stats      # see savings

## Supported tools

Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Cline, Amp, OpenCode, Kimi Code, Gemini CLI,
Codex. See the project README for per-tool integration details.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/prxm-labs/tok0/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
